  m_text: "Michael,\r\n\r\nI spoke with them today. It\u2019s all arranged. They
    can take him at the end of the week. I know we wanted Leo to stay longer, but
    I think this is what\u2019s best for him. We can\u2019t keep putting this off.\r\n\r\nLet\u2019s
    talk more tonight.\r\n\r\n\u2014A.\r\n"
